---
import Button from "../Button.astro"
import '@fontsource/gothic-a1';
---

<section class="relative min-h-dvh overflow-hidden bg-[#242331] font-gothic">
  <video
    autoplay
    loop
    muted
    playsinline
    src="/video/videoHero.mp4"
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
  ></video>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#242331]/70"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-dvh max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-5xl">
      <h1 class="text-[#FBFFF1] uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.02em]">
        <span class="block text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium">
          Calidad en el corte
        </span>

        <span class="mt-2 block text-5xl sm:mt-3 sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold">
          Calidez en la atención
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-[#FBFFF1]/85 sm:text-lg lg:text-xl">
        Cortes, barba y atención personalizada en Ituzaingó, con criterio y atención al detalle. Reservá tu turno online.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <Button
          classString="inline-block w-full max-w-[400px] rounded-xl bg-[#3E52D5] px-6 py-4 text-center text-[16px] font-extrabold uppercase text-white transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[#586DF3] sm:text-[22px]"
          buttonText="Quiero un turno"
          buttonLink="https://www.fresha.com/es/a/stylos-barber-ituzaingo-general-miguel-soler-398-jtabqara/booking?allOffer=true&menu=true"
        />
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm text-[#FBFFF1]/80 sm:text-base">
        <span>Soler 398, Ituzaingó</span>
        <span class="hidden sm:inline">•</span>
        <span>9:30 a 20 hs.</span>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">•</span>
          <span>Martes a sábado</span>  
        
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>